hadiths[91]{hadithnumber,text}:
"661","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai ke Ibn Tawus ne mujh se kaha ke mere walid ke paas diyat ke bare mein ek kitab hai jis ke sath wahi nazil hui. Aur jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne diyat aur sadqa mein se farz kiya to woh wahi ke sath nazil hua."
"662","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke in ke paas diyat ke bare mein ek kitab hai jis ke sath wahi nazil hui. Aur jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sadqa aur diyat mein se farz kiya to woh wahi ke sath nazil hua. Aur kaha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne koi cheez Allah Azza wa Jalla ki wahi ke baghair sunnat qaraar nahin di. Wahi mein se baaz woh hai jo tilawat ki jati hai aur baaz woh hai jo Aap ke Rasool ki taraf wahi hoti hai aur Aap us se sunnat qaim karte hain."
"663","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon par sadqa fitr farz kiya ek sa' khajoor ya ek sa' jau, har aazad aur ghulam, mard aur aurat par jo Musalmanon mein se hon."
"664","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sadqa fitr farz kiya har aazad aur ghulam, mard aur aurat par jin ki tum kafalat karte ho."
"665","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham sadqa fitr mein ek sa' ghalla, ya ek sa' jau, ya ek sa' khajoor, ya ek sa' kishmish nikalte."
"666","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon par sadqa fitr farz kiya ek sa' khajoor ya ek sa' jau."
"667","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham sadqa fitr mein ek sa' ghalla, ek sa' jau, ek sa' khajoor, ek sa' kishmish, ya ek sa' paneer nikalte."
"668","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek sa' ghalla, ek sa' kishmish, ek sa' paneer, ek sa' khajoor, ya ek sa' jau nikalte. Ham isi tarah nikalte rahe yahan tak ke Mu'awiyah hajj ya umrah karne aae. Phir unhon ne logon se khutba kaha. Jo unhon ne logon se kaha is mein se tha ke unhon ne kaha: 'Meri rae mein Sham ki gandum ke do mudd khajoor ke ek sa' ke barabar hain.' To logon ne use le liya."
"669","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) sadqa fitr mein khajooron ke siwa kuch na nikalte, siwae ek martaba ke unhon ne jau nikale."
"670","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham sadqa fitr mein ek sa' ghalla, ek sa' jau, ek sa' khajoor, ek sa' kishmish, ya ek sa' paneer nikalte."
"671","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) sadqa fitr us ke paas bhejte jo jama karta tha, Fitr se do ya teen din pahle."
"672","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh sadqa fitr us ke paas bhejte jo jama karta tha, Fitr se do ya teen din pahle."
"673","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya jab unhen bheja: 'Agar woh tumhari baat manen to unhen batao ke in par sadqa hai jo in ke maal-daron se liya jaega aur in ke mohtajon mein wapas diya jaega.'"
"674","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main tumhen Allah ki qasam de kar poochta hun, kya Allah ne tumhen hukm diya hai ke hamare maal-daron se sadqa lo aur hamare mohtajon mein wapas do? Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Han.'"
"675","[AI-translation] Qabeesah bin Mukhariq Hilali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne zamanat uthai. Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se manga. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Ham use ada karenge,' aur unhon ne hadees zikr ki."
"676","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar se riwayat hai ke do aadmiyon ne unhen khabar di ke woh donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap se sadqa manga. To Aap ne un donon ko upar neeche dekha aur farmaya: 'Agar tum chaho, magar is mein maal-daar ke liye koi hissa nahin, aur na taqatwar kamane wale ke liye.'"
"677","[AI-translation] Usamah bin Zaid Laisi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se zakat ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Tum khud do. To main ne kaha: Kya Ibn Umar nahin kahte the ke use hukmaran ko de do? Unhon ne kaha: Han, lekin main use hukmaran ko dene ko munasib nahin samajhta."
"678","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) se un ke bare mein kaha jo sadqa dene se inkar karte the: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nahin farmaya: Main hamesha logon se ladunga yahan tak ke woh kahen: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin. Jab woh kahen to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye siwae is ke haq ke, aur in ka hisab Allah par hai. To Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Yeh is ke haq mein se hai, yani in ka sadqa dene se inkar karna."
"679","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main hamesha logon se ladunga yahan tak ke woh kahen: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin. Jab woh Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin kahen to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye siwae is ke haq ke, aur in ka hisab Allah par hai.' Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Yeh is ke haq mein se hai. Agar woh rassi bhi rok len jo woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dete the to main in se is par ladunga."
"680","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) se yeh baat ya is ke hum-ma'na kahi."
"681","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo apne maal ki zakat ada na kare to qayamat ke din is ke liye ganja saanp banaya jaega. Woh is se bhagega jabke woh is ke peeche lagega yahan tak ke use is ki gardan mein tauq bana kar dalega.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare samne tilawat farmayi: Jald inhen us cheez ka tauq pahnaya jaega jis mein unhon ne bukhl kiya qayamat ke din [Aal Imran: 180]."
"682","[AI-translation] Abu Salih Samman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jo apne maal ki zakat ada na kare to qayamat ke din is ke liye ganja saanp banaya jaega jis ki aankhon par do nukte hain. Woh use talash karega yahan tak ke use pa lega aur kahega: Main tumhara khazana hun."
"683","[AI-translation] Abu Salih Samman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jo apne maal ki zakat ada na kare to qayamat ke din is ke liye ganja saanp banaya jaega jis ki aankhon par do nukte hain. Woh use talash karega yahan tak ke use pa lega aur kahega: Main tumhara khazana hun."
"684","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhum) se kanz ke bare mein poochte suna. To unhon ne kaha: Woh maal hai jis ki tum zakat ada na karo."
"685","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) farmate the: Har maal jis ki zakat ada ki jae woh khazana nahin, agarche woh dafan ho. Aur har maal jis ki zakat ada na ki jae woh khazana hai, agarche woh dafan na ho."
"686","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Yasar se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Koi banda halal kamai se sadqa na kare, aur Allah sirf halal qabool karta hai, aur Allah tak sirf halal pahunchta hai, magar goya woh use Rahman Azza wa Jalla ke hath mein rakhta hai aur Woh use is ke liye badhata hai jaise tum mein se koi apne bachaunde ko palta hai yahan tak ke ek luqma qayamat ke din aae jabke woh bade pahad jaisa ho.' Phir tilawat ki: Beshak Allah hi apne bandon se tauba qabool karta hai aur sadqat leta hai [Taubah: 104]."
"687","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kharch karne wale aur bakheel ki misal do aadmiyon jaisi hai jin par seenon se hansliyon tak do zirahen hon. Jab kharch karne wala kharch karna chahe to zirah is par kushada ho jati hai ya guzarti hai yahan tak ke is ke kapde dhanp leti hai aur is ke nishan mita deti hai. Aur jab bakheel kharch karna chahe to woh tang ho jati hai aur har halqa apni jagah chipak jata hai yahan tak ke is ki gardan ya hansli pakad leti hai. Woh use kushada karta hai magar woh kushada nahin hoti.'"
"688","[AI-translation] Tawus se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai, siwae is ke ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh use kushada karta hai magar woh kushada nahin hota.'"
"689","[AI-translation] Sha'bi se, Jarir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tumhare paas sadqa jama karne wala aae to woh tumhen khush kiye baghair na jae.'"
"690","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ashja' qabeela ke do aadmiyon ne khabar di ke Muhammad bin Maslamah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) in ke paas sadqa jama karne wale ban kar aate. Phir woh maal ke maalik se kahte: Apne maal ka sadqa mujhe nikal kar do. Jab bhi un ke paas aisi bakri lai jati jis mein is ke haq ki adaaigi hoti to woh use qabool kar lete."
"691","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Maal par zakat wajib nahin yahan tak ke us par saal guzar jae.'"
"692","[AI-translation] Sa'ib bin Yazeed se riwayat hai ke Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) farmaya karte: 'Yeh tumhari zakat ka maheena hai. Jis par qarz ho woh apna qarz ada kare taake tumhare maal khalis ho jaen phir un mein se zakat ada karo.'"
"693","[AI-translation] Qudamah se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab main Usman bin Affan ke paas apna wazeefa lene aata to woh mujh se poochte: 'Kya tumhare paas maal hai jis mein zakat wajib hui hai?' Agar main kahta: Han, to woh mere wazeefe se us maal ki zakat le lete. Aur agar main kahta: Nahin, to woh mujhe mera wazeefa de dete."
"694","[AI-translation] Muthanna bin Anas ya falan bin Anas se, Shafi'i ko shak hua, Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yeh sadqa hai. Phir bakriyan aur is ke siwa chhod diya gaya, aur logon ne use napasand kiya. Bismillahir Rahmanir Raheem. Yeh sadqe ka woh fareeza hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Musalmanon par farz kiya jis ka Allah ne hukm diya hai. Jo momin is ka us ke tareeqe par sawal kare to use dena chahiye, aur jo is se zyada mange to use na de. Chaubees oonton aur is se neeche bakriyan: Har paanch mein ek bakri. Jab pachees se paintis tak pahunchen to is mein ek saala maada oontni hai. Agar is mein ek saala maada na ho to do saala narr oont hai. Jab chhattis se paintalis tak pahunchen to is mein do saala maada oontni hai. Jab chhiyalis se saath tak pahunchen to is mein hiqqah hai jo narr ke qabil ho gai ho. Jab iksath se pachihattar tak pahunchen to is mein jaza'ah hai. Jab chhihattar se nabbe tak pahunchen to is mein do do saala maada oontniyan hain. Jab ikanwe se ek sau bees tak pahunchen to is mein do hiqqah hain jo narr ke qabil ho gai hon. Jab ek sau bees se zyada ho jaen to har chalis mein do saala maada oontni aur har pachaas mein hiqqah hai. Aur agar sadqe ke fareeze mein oonton ki umren mukhtalif hon: Jis par jaza'ah ka sadqa wajib hua jabke is ke paas jaza'ah na ho aur is ke paas hiqqah ho to is se hiqqah qabool ki jaegi aur woh is ke sath do bakriyan de agar is par aasan hon ya bees dirham. Jab is par hiqqah wajib hui jabke is ke paas hiqqah na ho aur is ke paas jaza'ah ho to is se jaza'ah qabool ki jaegi, aur sadqa jama karne wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega."
"695","[AI-translation] Kayeen siqah rawiyon se, sab Hammad bin Salamah se, Aamir se, Thumamah bin Abdullah bin Anas se, Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ma'na ki misl riwayat hai jo is ke khilaf nahin hai, siwae is ke ke mujhe is mein yaad hai: Woh do bakriyan ya bees dirham nahin dega, mujhe yaad nahin agar woh donon is par aasan hon. Unhon ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai Hammad ki Anas se hadees mein se ke unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sadqe ki kitab di aur yeh ma'na zikr kiya jaise main ne wasf kiya."
"696","[AI-translation] Musa bin Uqbah se, Nafi' se, Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke yeh sadqat ki kitab hai. Is mein hai: Har chaubees oonton aur is se neeche bakriyan: Har paanch mein ek bakri. Is se upar paintis tak ek saala maada oontni. Agar ek saala maada na ho to do saala narr oont. Is se upar paintalis tak do saala maada oontni. Is se upar saath tak narr ke qabil hiqqah. Is se upar pachihattar tak jaza'ah. Is se upar nabbe tak do do saala maada oontniyan. Is se upar ek sau bees tak do hiqqah narr ke qabil. Jo is se zyada ho to har chalis mein do saala maada oontni aur har pachaas mein hiqqah hai. Aur charne wali bakriyon mein jab chalis se ek sau bees tak pahunchen to ek bakri. Is se upar do sau tak do bakriyan. Is se upar teen sau tak teen bakriyan. Jo is se zyada ho to har sau bakriyon mein ek bakri. Aur sadqe mein budhi, aib wali, aur bakra na nikala jae siwae jo sadqa jama karne wala chahe. Aur sadqe ke khauf se juda ko jama na kiya jae aur jama ko juda na kiya jae. Aur jo do shareekon ka ho to woh donon aapas mein barabar ruju' karen. Aur chaandi mein chauthai dahai jab in mein se kisi ki chaandi paanch ooqiya tak pahunche. Yeh Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ki kitab ka nuskha hai."
"697","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Husain se, Zuhri se, Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar se, apne walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, riwayat hai, main nahin janta ke Ibn Umar ne apne aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke darmiyan Umar ko Sufyan bin Husain ki hadees mein dakhil kiya ya nahin, oonton ke sadqe ke bare mein isi ma'na ki misl riwayat hai jo is ke khilaf nahin hai. Main use nahin janta, balke agar Allah chahe to mujhe shak nahin magar us ne mujhe bakriyon, shareekon, aur chaandi ke sadqe ke bare mein poori hadees isi tarah bayan ki, siwae is ke ke mujhe is ki hadees mein oonton ke siwa yaad nahin."
"698","[AI-translation] Bashar bin Aasim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Sufyan bin Abdullah ko Taif aur is ke gird par zakat jama karne wala muqarrar kiya. Jab woh sadqa jama karne nikle to unhon ne in par bakri ke bachche gine. Jabke woh un mein se na lete the, to logon ne kaha: 'Agar tum ham par bakri ke bachche ginte ho to tum ham se use lo bhi.' Woh ruke rahe yahan tak ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se mile aur un se kaha: 'Jaan len ke woh samajhte hain ke tum in par zulm karte ho: Tum in par bakri ke bachche ginte ho magar un mein se use lete nahin.' To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: 'In par bakri ke bachche gino yahan tak ke woh bacha jise charwaha apne hath par lekar aae, aur un se kaho: Main tum se doodh pilane wali, haamla, doodh dene wali, khane wali bakri, aur bakron ka narr nahin lunga. Aur anaak, jaza'ah aur thaniyah lo. Yahi maal ke bachchon aur is ke behtareen ke darmiyan adl hai.'"
"699","[AI-translation] Amr bin Abi Sufyan se, ek aadmi se jise Ibn Sa'd ne naam lekar pukara agar Allah chahe, Sa'd jo Banu Adi ke bhai hain, se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas do aadmi aae aur kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen logon ke maal ka sadqa jama karne bheja hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne in donon ke liye haamla bakri nikali jo sab se behtar thi jo main ne pai. To un donon ne use mujh par radd kar diya, aur kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen haamla bakri lene se mana farmaya hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne in donon ko darmiyani bakriyan deen aur un donon ne use le liya."
"700","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja mutahhara Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab ke samne sadqe ki bakriyan guzari gain. To unhon ne un mein doodh se bhare than wali bakri dekhi. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Yeh kaunsi bakri hai?' To unhon ne kaha: 'Sadqe ki bakri hai.' To Umar ne farmaya: 'Is ke ghar walon ne use khushi se nahin diya. Logon ko fitne mein na dalo. Musalmanon ki behtareen cheezen na lo. Khane se bacho.'"
"701","[AI-translation] Thawus Yamani se riwayat hai ke Mu'az bin Jabal ne tees gaon se tabi' liya, aur chalis se musinnah. Aur is se kam laya gaya to unhon ne is mein se kuch lene se inkar kar diya aur kaha: 'Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein kuch nahin suna yahan tak ke main Aap se milun aur Aap se poochun.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Mu'az ke aane se pahle faut ho gae."
"702","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas gaon ke waqsh lae gae. To unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe is ke bare mein kisi cheez ka hukm nahin diya. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Waqsh woh hai jo fareeze tak na pahunche."
"703","[AI-translation] Apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch oonton se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"704","[AI-translation] Apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) ne khabar di: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch oonton se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"705","[AI-translation] Apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Sa'id Khudri ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch oonton se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"706","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Irak bin Malik se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musalman par is ke ghulam aur is ke ghode mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"707","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Irak bin Malik se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"708","[AI-translation] Irak bin Malik ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah mauqoof riwayat kiya."
"709","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin Musayyab se jangi ghodon ke sadqe ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Kya ghodon mein sadqa hai?"
"710","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Salamah se, Abu Amr bin Himas se riwayat hai ke in ke walid ne kaha: Main Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas se guzra jabke meri gardan par chamda tha jo main uthae hue tha. To Umar ne farmaya: Kya tum apni zakat ada nahin karte Aey Himas? To main ne kaha: Ya Ameerul Momineen! Mere paas is ke siwa kuch nahin jo meri peeth par hai aur qaraz mein chamda. To unhon ne kaha: Yeh maal hai, rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne use in ke samne rakha. Phir unhon ne use gina aur paya ke is mein zakat wajib hui hai. Phir unhon ne is mein se zakat li."
"711","[AI-translation] Abu Amr bin Himas se, apne walid se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"712","[AI-translation] Zuraiq bin Hakeem se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne unhen likha: Dekho jo Musalman tumhare paas se guzre to in ke zahir tijarati maalon mein se lo: Har chalis dinar mein se ek dinar. Jo kam ho to hisab se yahan tak ke bees dinar tak pahunche. Agar ek tihaai dinar kam ho to use chhod do aur is mein se kuch na lo."
"713","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Mahak se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yateem ke maal mein ya yateemon ke maal mein tijarat karo taake zakat use khatm na kare.'"
"714","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne meri, main aur mere do bhai jo yateem the in ki parwarish ki. Woh hamare maal se zakat nikalti thin."
"715","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne meri aur mere bhai ki parwarish ki. Woh hamare maal se zakat nikalti thin."
"716","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke woh yateem ke maal ki zakat dete."
"717","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Yateemon ke maal mein tijarat karo taake zakat use khatm na kare."
"718","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) hamare maal ki zakat deti thin, jabke is se Bahrain mein tijarat ki jati thi."
"719","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Tijarati maal mein zakat nahin jab tak is se tijarat ka irada na ho.'"
"720","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke woh apne bhai ki yateem betiyon ki parwarish karti thin. In ke paas zewar the magar woh un mein se zakat na nikalti thin."
"721","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) apne bhai ki betiyon ko sone ke zewar pahnati thin aur is ki zakat na nikalti thin."
"722","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke in ki betiyon aur laundiyon par sona hota magar woh is mein se zakat na nikalte."
"723","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek aadmi ko Jabir bin Abdullah se zewar ke bare mein poochte suna ke kya is mein zakat hai? To Jabir ne kaha: Nahin. To us ne kaha: Agarche woh hazaar dinar tak pahunche? To Jabir ne kaha: Zyada hai."
"724","[AI-translation] Apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch ooqiya chaandi se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"725","[AI-translation] Apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Sa'id Khudri ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch ooqiya se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"726","[AI-translation] Amr bin Yahya Mazini se isi hadees ke sath riwayat hai."
"727","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab aur Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Rikaz mein panchwan hissa hai.'"
"728","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Dafeena mein panchwan hissa hai.'"
"729","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab aur Abu Salamah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Dafeena mein panchwan hissa hai.'"
"730","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us khazane ke bare mein farmaya jo ek aadmi ne zamana jahiliyat ke khandaron mein paya: 'Agar tum use aabad basti ya aam raste mein pao to is ka elaan karo. Aur agar tum use zamana jahiliyat ke khandaron ya ghair aabad basti mein pao to is mein aur rikaz mein panchwan hissa hai.'"
"731","[AI-translation] Sha'bi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main ne Sawad ke khandaron mein pandrah sau dirham pae. To Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Main is mein wazeh faisla karunga. Agar tum ne use aisi basti mein paya jo us ka khiraj doosri basti ko deti hai to yeh maal us basti walon ka hai. Aur agar tum ne use aisi basti mein paya jo us ka khiraj doosri basti ko nahin deti to tumhare liye chaar panchwan hain aur hamare liye panchwan, phir panchwan tumhare liye hai."
"732","[AI-translation] Sa'id aur Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Dafeena mein panchwan hissa hai.'"
"733","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke un se ambar ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Agar is mein kuch ho to is mein panchwan hissa hai."
"734","[AI-translation] Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) se ambar ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Agar is mein kuch ho to is mein panchwan hissa hai."
"735","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) ne farmaya: Ambar mein zakat nahin, yeh sirf woh cheez hai jo samandar kinare par phenkta hai."
"736","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ambar mein kuch nahin, yeh sirf woh cheez hai jo samandar upar phenkta hai."
"737","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Attab bin Usaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne angooron ki zakat ke bare mein farmaya: 'Is ka andaza lagaya jaega jaise khajooron ka andaza lagaya jata hai. Phir is ki zakat kishmish mein ada ki jaegi jaise khajooron ki zakat khajoor mein ada ki jati hai.'"
"738","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ke paas unhen bhejte jo in ke angooron aur phalon ka andaza lagate."
"739","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh farmate the: Phalon aur kheton ka sadqa jo khajoor, angoor, khet, jau, ya sult hon: Jo barani hon, ya nahar se serab hon, ya chashme se serab hon, ya barish se serab hon to is mein dahai hai, har das mein ek. Aur jo dol se pani de kar serab hon to is mein aadha dahai hai, har bees mein ek. Aur jo dol se pani de kar serab hon to is mein aadha dahai hai, har bees mein ek."
"740","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abi Zubab se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Islam laya. Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri qaum ke liye muqarrar kar den jo woh Islam lae hain is ke maal mein se. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aisa kiya aur mujhe in par aamil muqarrar kiya. Phir Abu Bakr ne mujhe aamil muqarrar kiya, phir Umar ne. Unhon ne kaha: Sa'd Sarah walon mein se the. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne apni qaum se shehad ke bare mein baat ki aur un se kaha: Zakat hai. Kyunke us phal mein koi bhalai nahin jis ki zakat na di jae. To unhon ne kaha: Kitni? Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Dahai. Phir main ne un se dahai liya aur Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur unhen khabar di. To Umar ne use qabool kiya, use becha, phir is ki qeemat ko Musalmanon ke sadqat mein shamil kar diya."
"741","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabat se gandum aur tail mein se aadha dahai lete taake Madinah ki taraf rasad zyada ho. Aur woh dalon mein se dahai lete."
"742","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Utbah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein Madinah ke bazar par Abdullah bin Utbah ke sath aamil tha. Woh Nabat se dahai lete."
"743","[AI-translation] Apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Khajoor ke paanch wasaq se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"744","[AI-translation] Apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Sa'id Khudri ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch wasaq se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"745","[AI-translation] Apne walid se, Abu Sa'id Khudri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Paanch wasaq se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"746","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Sa'idi se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Asad qabeela ke ek aadmi ko jise Ibn Lutbiyah kaha jata tha sadqe par aamil muqarrar kiya. Jab woh wapas aaya to kaha: Yeh tumhara maal hai, aur yeh mujhe tohfe mein diya gaya hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mimbar par khade hue aur farmaya: 'Us aamil ko kya hai jise ham apne baaz kaamon par bhejte hain, phir woh kahta hai: Yeh tumhara maal hai, aur yeh mera hai? Woh apne baap ke ghar ya apni maa ke ghar kyun na baitha raha aur dekhta ke use tohfa diya jata hai ya nahin? Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Jo is mein se kuch lega to woh qayamat ke din use apni gardan par uthae hue aaega. Agar oont hua to woh rarraega, ya gae hui to woh rambhaegi, ya bakri hui to woh mimiyaegi.' Phir Aap ne apne donon hath uthae yahan tak ke ham ne Aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi, phir farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Kya main ne pahuncha diya? Aey Allah! Kya main ne pahuncha diya?'"
"747","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Sa'idi se riwayat hai ke meri aankh ne dekha aur mere kaan ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna, aur Zaid bin Sabit se poocho, yani isi ki misl."
"748","[AI-translation] Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ubadah bin Samit ko sadqe par aamil muqarrar kiya, aur farmaya: 'Aey Abul Waleed! Daro! Kahin tum qayamat ke din oont apni gardan par uthae hue na aao jo rarra raha ho, ya gae jo rambha rahi ho, ya bakri jo mimiya rahi ho.' To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya waqai aisa hoga? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han, us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, siwae is ke jis par Allah raham kare.' Unhon ne kaha: Us ki qasam jis ne tumhen haq ke sath bheja! Main kabhi do par bhi aamil nahin banunga."
"749","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja mutahhara Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sadqa maal se nahin milta magar use halak kar deta hai.'"
"750","[AI-translation] Aslam se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Is sawar qafle mein ek andhi oontni hai. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne poocha: Kya yeh jizya ke oonton se hai ya sadqe ke oonton se? To Aslam ne kaha: Jizya ke oonton se hai. Unhon ne kaha: Is par jizya ka daagh hai."
"751","[AI-translation] Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab main Usman ke sath Aliyah mein in ke maal mein garmi ke din tha to unhon ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo do jawan oont hank raha tha jabke zameen par garmi se bistar jaisa tha. To unhon ne kaha: Is par kya hai agar woh Madinah mein thahre yahan tak ke thandak ho jae phir jae? Phir woh aadmi qareeb aaya. To unhon ne kaha: Dekho yeh kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main ek aadmi ko dekhta hun jo apni chadar se amama bandhe do jawan oont hank raha hai. Phir woh aadmi qareeb aaya. To unhon ne kaha: Dekho. To main ne dekha to Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) the. To main ne kaha: Yeh Ameerul Momineen hain. To Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) khade hue aur apna sar darwaze se bahar nikala, magar garm hawa ke jhonke ne unhen takleef di aur unhon ne apna sar wapas kar liya yahan tak ke woh in ke barabar aae. To unhon ne kaha: Tumhen is waqt kis ne nikala? To unhon ne kaha: Sadqe ke oonton mein se do jawan oont peeche rah gae, jabke sadqe ke oont ja chuke hain. Main chahta hun ke unhen hima se mila dun aur mujhe khadsha hai ke woh donon zaya ho jaen phir Allah mujh se in ke bare mein pooche. To Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Pani aur sae ki taraf aaen aur ham tumhari kifayat karen. To unhon ne kaha: Apne sae ki taraf wapas jao. Unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas jo tumhari kifayat kare woh hai. To unhon ne kaha: Apne sae ki taraf wapas jao. Phir woh chale gae. To Usman ne kaha: Jo qawi ameen ko dekhna chahe woh ise dekhe. Phir woh hamare paas wapas aae aur apne aap ko gira diya."
